WEBVTT

00:28:29.917 --> 00:28:31.976
Do we really believe it?

00:28:32.000 --> 00:28:35.768
Do we really believe
that out of many, one,

00:28:35.792 --> 00:28:37.809
a country with no unifying language,

00:28:37.833 --> 00:28:39.101
no unifying culture,

00:28:39.125 --> 00:28:41.559
no unifying religion,

00:28:41.583 --> 00:28:43.583
can we really become one people?

00:28:44.375 --> 00:28:46.976
All equal before the law?

00:28:47.000 --> 00:28:50.393
All bound together
with a belief in the rule of law?

00:28:50.417 --> 00:28:51.684
Do we really believe that

00:28:51.708 --> 00:28:54.309
or do we just think it's a nice saying

00:28:54.333 --> 00:28:57.000
to see on the back of a paper dollar?

00:28:58.208 --> 00:29:02.559
And for me, this is a referendum
on the American experiment.